{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/88333640261b11fa59bebccb618dc6ca.poster.avif?t=1761215547\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/88333640261b11fa59bebccb618dc6ca.webm?t=1761215547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/88333640261b11fa59bebccb618dc6ca.mp4?t=1761215547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triumvora is a <strong>Roguelite</strong> with <strong>Survival</strong>,<strong>\u00a0Simulation</strong> and <strong>Hack 'n Slash</strong> elements, set in an infinite city overtaken by bright flora and fauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious creatures have claimed the top of the food chain, but their social hierarchies are turning into chaos. Live through one's eyes and grow from a weakling to the city's ruler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/ed6efb4b6042c035d577a2a0d191c188.avif?t=1761215547\" width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food is limited and in high demand.</strong> Will you eat it, stash it for hard times, or share it? Will you protect your stockpiles or raid others\u2019? Maximise your resources in a limited time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/6672ff1d5bd1a13c8a0f45daebf46f25.avif?t=1761215547\" width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These strange beings are able to see and absorb Aura, concentrated sources of the universe\u2019s energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How will you assert your power?</strong> Through the wealth of your stockpiles, the number of loyal allies you've gathered, or pure aggression?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/9599634f9a9d8d24a0d72febc6744733.avif?t=1761215547\" width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overthrow the old Rulers and their corrupted Crowns. Become a better pack leader than them, and strive for Unchallenged Rulership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death won't be the end of your rule. <strong>There's higher powers at play here</strong>, which can make good use of your hard-earned Aura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LABOUR OF LOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of unique Indie games, do <strong>wishlist this</strong>! Triumvora is made by a solo developer (hi!) and I've put in a lot of love and care in every aspect of it, from the gameplay to the art.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First of Many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/f69dcd87c9e3da884869531f20fc9a716961e17f.jpg"},{"name":"New Moves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/e190aa745ba1de409b9565d9a261dbbba53bdc4e.jpg"},{"name":"Total Rulership","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/3af517b7498afe906e254802c16a84fee8dee5e2.jpg"},{"name":"Versatility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/fa4906f669c4f992f5d0c33e4ebb6cf1d91998ea.jpg"},{"name":"Unchallenged Rulership","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/62dede18fb3161bc5a93ebfae7d86ad38bf00f91.jpg"},{"name":"Masterful Moves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/ab45c0550d81263724c6ca5bad125c48a4e665ad.jpg"},{"name":"Heart of Concrete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/35bd31000d4566f78b3247d6d6c4faf2734f020b.jpg"},{"name":"Sharing Is Caring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/0126b82ca319e928fd9d3f19292bc5acfdd0c34c.jpg"},{"name":"Brute Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/869e46e106e07c20dd6a51ac2c3bd15f61f946ae.jpg"},{"name":"Many of Many More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549120/6f31b3224f2764e364506a3c161aec94e0aaada4.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549120?t=1761215547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549120?t=1761215547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/0a2ac73bf6b8b0b20664623c9c77aafe762bb8bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761215547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/0a2ac73bf6b8b0b20664623c9c77aafe762bb8bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761215547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta