've gathered, or pure aggression?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/extras/9599634f9a9d8d24a0d72febc6744733.avif?t=1761215547\" width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overthrow the old Rulers and their corrupted Crowns. Become a better pack leader than them, and strive for Unchallenged Rulership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death won't be the end of your rule. <strong>There's higher powers at play here</strong>, which can make good use of your hard-earned Aura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LABOUR OF LOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of unique Indie games, do <strong>wishlist this</strong>! Triumvora is made by a solo developer (hi!) and I've put in a lot of love and care in every aspect of it, from the gameplay to the art.</p>","developers":["Bliss by Bits"],"dlc":[4046270],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549120/3e2e03255a5ef30fb198aba8dbaecf5b10e2939a/header.jpg?t=1761215547","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3549120/334980053/078c165ff35551dbdbca0b2819629a8369e1a46f/1758128727/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758136211","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3549120/334980053/078c165ff35551dbdbca0b2819629a8369e1a46f/1758128727/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758136211","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vi